{"type":"standard","title":"John James (Michigan politician)","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">John James (Michigan politician)</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q56027187","titles":{"canonical":"John_James_(Michigan_politician)","normalized":"John James (Michigan politician)","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">John James (Michigan politician)</span></span>"},"pageid":58192172,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b6/Rep._John_James_official_photo%2C_118th_Congress.jpg/330px-Rep._John_James_official_photo%2C_118th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b6/Rep._John_James_official_photo%2C_118th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":3360,"height":4200},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1374880077","tid":"ec66d135-b057-11f1-ae4a-cdbcdf3044c9","timestamp":"2026-09-14T16:18:30Z","description":"American politician and businessman (born 1981)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_James_(Michigan_politician)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_James_(Michigan_politician)?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_James_(Michigan_politician)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:John_James_(Michigan_politician)"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_James_(Michigan_politician)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/John_James_(Michigan_politician)","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_James_(Michigan_politician)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:John_James_(Michigan_politician)"}},"extract":"John Edward James is an American politician, businessman, and former military officer serving as the U.S. representative for Michigan's 10th congressional district since 2023. A member of the Republican Party, he was the party's nominee for U.S. Senate in 2018 and 2020.","extract_html":"<p><b>John Edward James</b> is an American politician, businessman, and former military officer serving as the U.S. representative for Michigan's 10th congressional district since 2023. A member of the Republican Party, he was the party's nominee for U.S. Senate in 2018 and 2020.</p>"}